I18n.add({fr:{"How to play":"Comment jouer",Skip:"Passer",Back:"Retour","Next ▶️":"Suivant ▶️","👍 Got it!":"👍 J'ai compris !","Your army shoots all by itself! Stop the enemy before it breaks in.":"Ton armée tire toute seule ! Arrête l'ennemi avant qu'il n'entre.","Slide your finger on the field to move your army. You can also hold ⬅️ ➡️, or use the arrow keys.":"Glisse ton doigt sur le terrain pour bouger ton armée. Tu peux aussi garder ⬅️ ➡️ appuyé, ou utiliser les flèches.","You are behind the wall! Tap or drag to move the cross-hair: your army shoots where it points. Hold ⬅️ ➡️ to look around.":"Tu es derrière le mur ! Touche ou glisse pour bouger le viseur : ton armée tire là où il vise. Garde ⬅️ ➡️ appuyé pour regarder autour.","Shoot a box to open it: a new weapon, more soldiers, a bigger wall or a shield.":"Tire sur une boîte pour l'ouvrir : une nouvelle arme, plus de soldats, un mur plus grand ou un bouclier.","The enemy breaks your wall first, then hits your ❤️. Don't let it reach zero!":"L'ennemi casse d'abord ton mur, puis touche ton ❤️. Ne le laisse pas tomber à zéro !","Knock out the King Tank to win the game. Tap the field to start!":"Mets KO le Roi des chars pour gagner la partie. Touche le terrain pour commencer !","Tap 🏘️ to open your city. Careful: the battle goes on while you are there!":"Touche 🏘️ pour ouvrir ta ville. Attention : la bataille continue pendant ce temps !","Give your people jobs. Farmers 🌾 make the food that everyone eats.":"Donne un métier à tes habitants. Les fermiers 🌾 font la nourriture que tout le monde mange.","Build houses so more people come. Your city grows through 20 ages, from the Stone Age to the AI Empire!":"Construis des maisons pour que plus de gens viennent. Ta ville traverse 20 époques, de la Préhistoire à l'Empire de l'IA !","Your city makes your army: barracks train soldiers, the lab finds weapons, bricks fix the wall.":"Ta ville fait ton armée : la caserne entraîne des soldats, le labo trouve des armes, les briques réparent le mur.","Tap the map to explore your city: fly over it like a bird, or walk in its streets.":"Touche la carte pour explorer ta ville : vole au-dessus comme un oiseau, ou marche dans ses rues.","Tap 2D, 3D or FPS at the top to see the battle another way. It goes on just as it was!":"Touche 2D, 3D ou FPS en haut pour voir la bataille autrement. Elle continue comme avant !"},"zh-HK":{"How to play":"點樣玩",Skip:"跳過",Back:"返轉頭","Next ▶️":"下一步 ▶️","👍 Got it!":"👍 明白！","Your army shoots all by itself! Stop the enemy before it breaks in.":"你嘅軍隊會自己射！喺敵人衝入嚟之前擋住佢哋。","Slide your finger on the field to move your army. You can also hold ⬅️ ➡️, or use the arrow keys.":"喺戰場度滑手指就可以移動你嘅軍隊。你都可以撳住 ⬅️ ➡️，或者用方向鍵。","You are behind the wall! Tap or drag to move the cross-hair: your army shoots where it points. Hold ⬅️ ➡️ to look around.":"你喺城牆後面！㩒或者拖就可以移動準星：你嘅軍隊會射去準星指住嘅地方。撳住 ⬅️ ➡️ 就可以睇吓周圍。","Shoot a box to open it: a new weapon, more soldiers, a bigger wall or a shield.":"射個箱就會打開：新武器、多啲士兵、更大嘅牆或者盾牌。","The enemy breaks your wall first, then hits your ❤️. Don't let it reach zero!":"敵人會先打爛你嘅牆，跟住打你嘅 ❤️。唔好畀佢跌到零！","Knock out the King Tank to win the game. Tap the field to start!":"打低坦克大王就贏！㩒戰場開始！","Tap 🏘️ to open your city. Careful: the battle goes on while you are there!":"㩒 🏘️ 打開你嘅城市。小心：你喺城市嗰陣，打仗仲係繼續㗎！","Give your people jobs. Farmers 🌾 make the food that everyone eats.":"幫你啲人揾份工。農夫 🌾 整大家食嘅嘢。","Build houses so more people come. Your city grows through 20 ages, from the Stone Age to the AI Empire!":"起屋就會有多啲人嚟住。你嘅城市會經過 20 個時代，由史前時代去到人工智能帝國！","Your city makes your army: barracks train soldiers, the lab finds weapons, bricks fix the wall.":"你嘅城市幫你嘅軍隊：兵營訓練士兵，實驗室搵新武器，磚頭整返道牆。","Tap the map to explore your city: fly over it like a bird, or walk in its streets.":"㩒地圖就可以探索你嘅城市：好似雀仔咁喺上面飛，或者喺街度行。","Tap 2D, 3D or FPS at the top to see the battle another way. It goes on just as it was!":"㩒上面嘅 2D、3D 或者 FPS，就可以換個角度睇場仗。場仗會照住咁繼續！"}});